        "original_id": "ac9facbc-f97e-5fd9-b013-416e03989cc9",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Charles R. Black Jr., Paul Manafort, Peter G. Kelly, John F. Scruggs, James Healey\n- Companies: Prime Policy Group, Burson-Marsteller Global Public Relations, BKSH & Associates Worldwide, Timmons & Company\n- Places: Washington, D.C.\n- Roles: chairman, lawyer, lobbyist, political consultant\n\nFacts:\n- Charles R. Black Jr. was born in 1947.\n- Paul John Manafort Jr. was born on April 1, 1949.\n- Paul Manafort is an American lawyer, lobbyist, and political consultant.\n- BKSH & Associates Worldwide, also called Black, Kelly, Scruggs & Healey, was a Washington, D.C.-based lobbying firm.\n- BKSH & Associates Worldwide had principals Charles R. Black Jr., Peter G. Kelly, John F. Scruggs, and James Healey.\n- In 2010, BKSH & Associates Worldwide merged with Timmons & Company to form Prime Policy Group.\n- Charles R. Black Jr. is the current Chairman of Prime Policy Group.\n- Prime Policy Group is a public affairs firm and a subsidiary of Burson-Marsteller Global Public Relations.",
